      "imageUrl": "https://fides.community/app/uploads/2026/08/GDC_End2End_Digital-Business-Workflows_1.0.png",
      "userJourney": "Phase 1: KYB Setup (Bosch Representative &amp; Bundesanzeiger)\r\n1. Bosch Representativ presents personal attributes via EUDI Wallet to Bundesanzeiger (Spherity platform).\r\n2. Bundesanzeiger verifies official registry records and issues the EBWOID and EU Company Credential (EUCC) to the Bosch Business Wallet (Procivis).\r\nPhase 2: KYC Bank Onboarding (Bosch &amp; Deutsche Bank)\r\n3. Bosch presents its EBWOID and EUCC alongside multi-source attestations (Ownership, Control, UBO profiles) to Deutsche Bank (Procivis).\r\n4. Deutsche Bank automatically processes these datasets to trace and identify UBOs under EU AMLR rules.\r\n5. UBO verifies identity via EUDI Wallet, signs the contract using a wallet-bound QES, and Deutsche Bank issues a verified IBAN Attestation to Bosch.\r\nPhase 3: Supplier Cycle (SBB &amp; Bosch)\r\n6. SBB (Spherity) runs Phases 1 and 2 to establish its verified identity.\r\n7. SBB presents its credentials to Bosch for instant, automated KYS onboarding.\r\n8. SBB delivers ordered parts and issues a cryptographically signed eInvoice directly to Bosch.",
